  "details": "Add a system where users can request to clone another player’s avatar. The avatar owner receives a simple Yes / No prompt to approve or deny the request. Approved requests allow the avatar to be cloned; denied requests notify the requester politely.\n\nBenefits:\n\nProtects avatar creators from unauthorized copying.\n\nEncourages respectful sharing and social interaction.\n\nReduces reliance on external tools for avatar cloning.\n\nOptional Enhancements:\n\nAuto-approve for friends or trusted users.\n\nIntegration with existing trust/friend systems.\n\n \n\nGoal\n\nBalance creativity and sharing with creator rights, improving the VRChat community experience.",
